note Shared /allen/ browser contract; table index is the interpolation token ~N~.
note Served ids, gateway routes, the gateway's message limits (24 messages, 4000 characters each,
note 16000 in all, 16384 bytes of Omega source), the policy injected into a program's frame, its
note sandbox token, the model name shown before the stream names it, and the wasm call timeout in
note milliseconds occur only in this table, followed by the submit, status, introduce and forget
note routes, the privacy contact address, the status poll interval and poll limit in milliseconds,
note the standalone introduction button id, the review host for published projects, the forget-me
note route, the one local storage key the page may write, the key panel ids, the relay, presence,
note handoff, session and say routes, the presence poll in milliseconds, the presence line id and
note Drake's public X page and email address, the mode badge id, Drake's two greetings (remember
note and anonymous; the gateway prepends the same bytes) and a returning visitor's first line. Append new
note fields; never renumber. Every field, the last included, ends with byte 124.
note allen.om and allen-js.om are concatenated with this unit, never compiled independently.
note Compiled by the pinned omc of om/hive-page (sha256 in om/hive-page/omc.sha256).
text wires "allen|allen-log|allen-form|allen-input|allen-send|allen-stop|allen-status|allen-new|allen-model|allen-queue|allen-ttft|allen-first|allen-rate|allen-tokens|allen-server|allen-examples|/allen/api/chat|/allen/api/omega|24|4000|16000|16384|default-src 'none'; script-src 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src data:; form-action 'none'; base-uri 'none'|allow-scripts|qwen3.6-35b-a3b-fp8|3000|allen-intro|allen-privacy|/allen/api/submit|/allen/api/status/|/allen/api/introduce|/allen/api/forget|aien@aienos.com|3000|120000|allen-introduce|aien-dev.github.io/omega-projects/projects/|/allen/api/forget-me|allen.key|allen-key|allen-key-body|/allen/api/relay|/allen/api/presence|/allen/api/handoff|/allen/api/session|/allen/api/say|60000|allen-drake|https://x.com/mdrakestapleton|drake@aienos.com|allen-mode|Hey, I'm Allen. It's nice to meet you! You don't have to tell me your name, but if you do, that would be super awesome and we could chat over time. When you come back, I can remember who you are and we can pick up where we left off. We can talk about all kinds of good things in the universe.|Hey, I'm Allen. It's nice to meet you! We can talk about all kinds of good things in the universe.|(I am back.)|"
global output uchar 65536
global used ulong 1
global target int 1
global marker ulong 2

fn flush to void
p = ulong 0
while lt p get used 0 bound 65536
n = write get target 0 output p sub get used 0 p
if le n 0
trap 3
end
p = add p ulong n
end
put used 0 0
end

fn raw c uchar to void
if eq get used 0 len output
flush
end
put output get used 0 c
put used 0 add get used 0 1
end

fn wire k ulong to void
p = ulong 0
i = ulong 0
while lt p len wires
c = get wires p
if eq c 124
if eq i k
ret
end
i = add i 1
else
if eq i k
raw c
end
end
p = add p 1
end
trap 3
end

fn byteput c uchar to void
if eq c 126
if eq get marker 0 0
put marker 0 1
put marker 1 0
else
wire get marker 1
put marker 0 0
end
else
if eq get marker 0 1
if or lt c 48 gt c 57
trap 3
end
put marker 1 add mul get marker 1 10 ulong sub c 48
else
raw c
end
end
end
